<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Top Stories</title><subtitle type="html">Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Top Stories</subtitle><id>https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-top</id><updated>2026-09-07T14:20:42Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss-en-top" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.dw.com/english/?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><link rel="via" href="https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-top" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>Carbon capture tech exists. Scaling it up is the hard part</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5c8e078bd62d73508283d6c1bf76e502ae0e4dcea3469b01c26378cd28ce8266</id><updated>2026-09-07T14:20:05Z</updated><published>2026-09-07T14:12:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/carbon-capture-tech-exists-scaling-it-up-is-the-hard-part/a-79147600--ed63d6043f0b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/carbon-capture-tech-exists-scaling-it-up-is-the-hard-part/a-79147600?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Europe just opened a carbon capture and storage plant billed as the continent's largest. But global climate scenarios call for far more capacity than exists anywhere on Earth.</summary><category term="Climate" /></entry><entry><title>Pakistan: Can creating new provinces fix governance?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f39e75aab0d5198ded7983ee82fb398bcd6ac52830dbcf6f0f21ff55dbb86229</id><updated>2026-09-07T14:20:08Z</updated><published>2026-09-07T13:55:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/pakistan-can-creating-new-provinces-fix-governance/a-79148059--3974ef70363a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/pakistan-can-creating-new-provinces-fix-governance/a-79148059?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Pakistanis broadly agree that the country needs more responsive and effective government, but many question whether simply creating more provinces is the solution.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>EU's Von der Leyen pledges $232 million Greenland investment</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:32c913073c2d547b2c152eb55f62300319a12a4450ef9e5452e7e95e116f61a3</id><updated>2026-09-07T14:20:12Z</updated><published>2026-09-07T13:35:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eu-s-von-der-leyen-pledges-232-million-greenland-investment/a-79109197--af8beb0f9327.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/eu-s-von-der-leyen-pledges-232-million-greenland-investment/a-79109197?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The EU is preparing a major investment package and closer political ties with the Danish Arctic territory amid Donald Trump's demand for greater US control of the mineral-rich island.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Threatening letters revive fears among Kashmiri Pandits</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:515275ef26bbdafab53c8c84416c6d31549669670a2a32233d1b72700e1ec3f9</id><updated>2026-09-07T14:20:14Z</updated><published>2026-09-07T12:41:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/threatening-letters-revive-fears-among-kashmiri-pandits/a-79144481--ac4e07371076.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/threatening-letters-revive-fears-among-kashmiri-pandits/a-79144481?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Leaked addresses and phone numbers have reignited fears among Hindu government employees who returned to Muslim-majority Kashmir under a rehabilitation scheme.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Saxony-Anhalt: Germany wakes up to 'unsettling' AfD victory</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ec0dc58863cd35ee1660e42bfbd7c3f02ea826c5949477daf7b7cc549f449539</id><updated>2026-09-07T14:20:17Z</updated><published>2026-09-07T12:30:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/ww